{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52980","headline":"故功德使凉国公李将军挽歌词二首 一 · 赵迁","name":"故功德使凉国公李将军挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"业盛唐尧际，功成文子军。\n累承三帝宠，六比五臣勳。\n画角悲寒吹，愁笳咽晓云。\n圣朝忠义骨，今日委荒坟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵迁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}